# Title: HackTool - CrackMapExec PowerShell Obfuscation
# ID: 6f8b3439-a203-45dc-a88b-abf57ea15ccf
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Thomas Patzke
# Date: 2020-05-22
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1059.001, attack.t1027.005
# Description: The CrachMapExec pentesting framework implements a PowerShell obfuscation with some static strings detected by this rule.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*join*split*" OR process_exec="*( $ShellId[1]+$ShellId[13]+'x')*" OR process_exec="*( $PSHome[*]+$PSHOME[*]+*" OR process_exec="*( $env:Public[13]+$env:Public[5]+'x')*" OR process_exec="*( $env:ComSpec[4,*,25]-Join'')*" OR process_exec="*[1,3]+'x'-Join'')*")) AND (((process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe")) OR ((process_name="PowerShell.EXE" OR process_name="pwsh.dll"))))
